DTEND:20260405T120000Z
SUMMARY:Three Creeks Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The 13th annual Three Creeks Half Marathon is a flat\, fast\, and scenic race through Cherry Creek State Park. The course follows the banks of Cherry Creek\, Windmill Creek\, and Cottonwood Creek on a mix of road\, paved running trails\, and wide dirt trails with a total elevation gain of only 291 feet. The event includes a half marathon\, a 2-person relay option\, and a kids race with the Easter Bunny.
